  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MADWA Cooking Oil Expansion</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Agriculture (oilseeds).Beneficiaries: 1,373 smallholder female farmers.Location: Mansa District, Luapula Province.Summary: Mansa DWA will expand the operations of its cooking oil enterprise. The grant will fund increased purchase of oilseeds from local farmers, a new processing plant, adequate storage facilities, as well as procurement of a borehole and truck for distribution.</narrative>
  </description>
